$X$ is uniformly distributed on $[0,24]$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[-{Stealth}] (-0.5,0) -- (6.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[-{Stealth}] (0,-0.4) -- (0,3.0) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick] (1,0) -- (1,2) -- (5,2) -- (5,0);
\draw[dashed] (0,2) -- (1,2);
\node[below] at (1,0) {$0$};
\node[below] at (5,0) {$24$};
\node[left] at (0,2) {$\frac{1}{24}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Find $c$ so that $P(X\le c)=0.75$.

questions.solution_text:
$\frac{c-0}{24-0}=0.75$
$c=0.75\times 24$
$=18$
